#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:18
msgid "What is NeoMixer?"
msgstr "Mis on NeoMixer?"

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:19
msgid ""
"NeoMixer is a virtual audio mixer and router built on top of PipeWire."
" It lets you create virtual devices and freely route audio between your "
"inputs and outputs, controlling volume and muting along the way."
msgstr ""
"NeoMixer on PipeWire’i baasil loodud virtuaalne helimikser ja -ruuter. "
"Selle abil saad luua virtuaalseid seadmeid ning suunata heli vabalt "
"sisendite ja väljundite vahel, reguleerides samal ajal helivaljust ja "
"summutades seda."

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:24
msgid "The four device types"
msgstr "Neli seadmetüüpi"

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:25
msgid ""
"<b>Hardware Inputs</b> are physical sources such as microphones and line-"
"in.\n"
"<b>Virtual Inputs</b> are virtual sinks that applications can play into.\n"
"<b>Hardware Outputs</b> are physical sinks such as speakers and "
"headphones.\n"
"<b>Virtual Outputs</b> are virtual sources that applications can capture "
"from."
msgstr ""
"<b>Riistvaralised sisendid</b> on füüsilised allikad nagu mikrofonid või "
"ühendatud helikaablid..\n"
"<b>Virtuaalsed sisendid</b> on virtuaalsed väljundid, kuhu rakendused saavad "
"heli edastada.\n"
"<b>Riistvaralised väljundid</b> on füüsilised väljundseadmed nagu kõlarid "
"või mikrofonid..\n"
"<b>Virtuaalsed väljundid</b> on virtuaalsed allikad, mille sisendit "
"rakendused saavad kasutada/hõivata.."

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:31
msgid "Routing"
msgstr "Ruuting"

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:32
msgid ""
"Audio always flows from an input to an output: Hardware and Virtual "
"Inputs connect to Hardware and Virtual Outputs. Use the connection "
"toggles on each input device to send its audio to the outputs you want."
msgstr ""
"Heli liigub alati sisendist väljundisse: riistvara- ja virtuaalsed sisendid "
"ühendatakse riistvara- ja virtuaalsete väljunditega. Kasuta iga sisendseadme "
"ühenduslüliteid, et suunata selle heli soovitud väljunditesse."

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:37
msgid "Cleanup"
msgstr "Järelkoristus"

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:38
msgid ""
"NeoMixer has the ability to leave or cleanup the virtual device and "
"routes it creates with the cleanup setting. If NeoMixer is closed, it "
"won't be able to monitor for hotplugging"
msgstr ""
"NeoMixer on oskus virtuaalse seadme ja selle loodud marsruutide "
"allesjätmiseks või eemaldamiseks järelkoristuse seadistuse abil. Kui "
"NeoMixer suletakse, ei saa see enam jälgida seadmete ühendamist reaalajas"

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:43
msgid "Primary device"
msgstr "Põhiseade"

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:44
msgid ""
"Marking a device as primary makes it the default that new applications "
"attach to automatically. This sets the primary in PipeWire itself."
msgstr ""
"Seadme põhiliseks märkimine muudab selle vaikimisi seadmeks, millega uued "
"rakendused automaatselt ühenduvad. See määrab põhiseadme PipeWire'is endas."

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:48
msgid "VU meters & settings"
msgstr "VU-mõõdik ja seadistused"

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:49
msgid ""
"VU meters show the live volume peak of each device. Open the settings "
"menu to toggle VU meters, enable cleanup on exit, and switch between the "
"available layouts. Enabling VU Meters will show the inputs \"in use\" by "
"NeoMixer."
msgstr ""
"VU-mõõdikud näitavad iga seadme hetke helivaljuse tippväärtust. Ava "
"seadistuste menüü, et lülitada sisse või välja VU-mõõdikuid, aktiveerida "
"väljumisel nende eemaldamine (järelkoristus) ja valida sobiv paigutus. VU-"
"mõõdikute sisselülitamisel kuvatakse sisendid, mida NeoMixer „kasutab“."

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:55
msgid ""
"You can reopen this guide any time from the information button in the "
"settings menu."
msgstr ""
"Saad selle juhendi igal ajal uuesti avada seadistuste menüüs olevast "
"teabenupust."

